<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="zh-CN">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>化学实验练习 - 蒸馏操作与质量守恒定律验证</title>
<script type="text/javascript" id="MathJax-script" async
  src="https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/mathjax/3.2.2/es5/tex-mml-chtml.js">
</script>
<style>
  body {
    font-family: "SimSun", "Microsoft YaHei", serif;
    max-width: 700px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding: 20px 30px;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: #000;
    line-height: 1.9;
  }
  .section-title {
    text-align: center;
    margin: 15px 0 10px 0;
  }
  .section-title span {
    border: 1.5px solid #d21;
    color: #d21;
    font-weight: bold;
    font-size: 17px;
    padding: 2px 14px;
    display: inline-block;
  }
  .diagram-row {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: flex-end;
    margin: 10px 0 15px 0;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
  .placeholder {
    border: 1px dashed #999;
    background: #fafafa;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #777;
    box-sizing: border-box;
  }
  .ans {
    color: #c00;
    text-decoration: underline;
    font-weight: 500;
    padding: 0 2px;
  }
  p {
    margin: 6px 0;
  }
  .exp-caption {
    text-align: center;
    font-size: 13px;
    margin-top: 2px;
  }
  .exp-block {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .footer {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 25px;
    font-size: 12px;
    color: #555;
  }
</style>
</head>
<body>

  <div class="section-title"><span>八、蒸馏操作</span></div>

  <div class="diagram-row">
    <div class="placeholder" style="width:280px;height:150px;">
      [Diagram: 蒸馏装置（漏斗、烧瓶、酒精灯、铁架台）标注"沸石""碎瓷片"]
    </div>
    <div class="placeholder" style="width:230px;height:150px;">
      [Diagram: 蒸馏装置（冷凝管、锥形瓶）]
    </div>
  </div>

  <p>1.蒸馏是利用液体的 <span class="ans">沸点</span> 不同，分离液体混合物。</p>
  <p>2.碎瓷片的作用：<span class="ans">防止液体暴沸</span> 。</p>
  <p>3.冷凝水 <span class="ans">下端口</span> 进，<span class="ans">上端口</span> 出，以使冷凝管中充满冷水。</p>
  <p>4.开始馏出的液体为 <span class="ans">温沸点的杂质</span> ，应当弃去。</p>
  <p>5.简易蒸馏装置中长导管的作用是 <span class="ans">导气和冷凝</span> 。</p>

  <div class="section-title"><span>九、质量守恒定律验证</span></div>

  <div class="diagram-row">
    <div class="exp-block">
      <div class="placeholder" style="width:120px;height:120px;">
        [Diagram: 玻璃管、气球、红磷、细沙、天平实验1]
      </div>
      <div class="exp-caption">实验1</div>
    </div>
    <div class="exp-block">
      <div class="placeholder" style="width:120px;height:120px;">
        [Diagram: CuSO₄溶液、铁钉、天平实验2]
      </div>
      <div class="exp-caption">实验2</div>
    </div>
    <div class="exp-block">
      <div class="placeholder" style="width:120px;height:120px;">
        [Diagram: 稀盐酸、Na₂CO₃粉末、天平实验3]
      </div>
      <div class="exp-caption">实验3</div>
    </div>
    <div class="exp-block">
      <div class="placeholder" style="width:90px;height:120px;">
        [Diagram: 镁条燃烧实验4]
      </div>
      <div class="exp-caption">实验4</div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <p>1. 实验1的现象是 <span class="ans">白磷燃烧，产生大量白烟，气球先膨胀后萎瘪</span> 。</p>
  <p>气球的作用是 <span class="ans">缓冲压强，防止瓶塞被冲开</span> 。</p>
  <p>锥形瓶底放一些细沙的目的是 <span class="ans">防止锥形瓶炸裂</span> 。反应后，天平是否平衡？<span class="ans">是</span> 。</p>
  <p>2. 实验2的现象是 <span class="ans">铁钉表面出现红色固体，溶液由蓝色变浅绿色</span> 。</p>
  <p>化学方程式 <span class="ans">CuSO₄+Fe=FeSO₄+Cu</span> 。反应后，天平是否平衡？<span class="ans">是</span> 。</p>
  <p>3. 实验3结束后，天平是否平衡？<span class="ans">否</span> ，原因是 <span class="ans">反应生成的CO₂逸散到空气中</span> 。</p>
  <p>如何改进装置以验证质量守恒定律 <span class="ans">在密闭容器中进行实验</span> 。</p>
  <p>4. 实验4：反应前称量镁条和石棉网质量，反应后称量石棉网和燃烧后得到的产物质量：</p>
  <p>①如果测得反应后质量比反应前质量大，原因 <span class="ans">增加了空气中的氧元素的质量</span> 。</p>
  <p>②如果测得反应后质量比反应前质量小，原因 <span class="ans">镁条燃烧时形成白烟逸散到空气中</span> 。</p>

  <div class="footer">6 / 13</div>

</body>
</html>
